  s0: Old session and a queued input
  s1: Seed committed at the queue head#59; gate holds it
  s2: Restart holds the transition and fence
  s3: Exact close confirmed#59; retire and settle
  s4: Old execution retired#59; exclusion still held
  s5: Exclusion released#59; seed waits for the owner
  s6: Owner turn installed Pending and creates
  s7: Clear won: seed dropped, selector forgotten
  s8: A cleared seed was queued again
  s9: Clear reported a hold: a turn was launching
  s10: A launch resumed the conversation a clear ended
  s11: One new Ready session#59; inputs await the owner
  s12: One new Ready session#59; inputs settled once
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Commit the seed original (acceptance)
  s1 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s2 --> s3: Close only the captured pane
  s3 --> s4: Retire CAS and settle the old turn
  s3 --> s3: User clear reads the row
  s4 --> s5: Disconnect keeping selector, release, wake
  s4 --> s4: User clear reads the row or Clear discards the queue with receipts or Clear's terminate times out on the transition or Accept an input into the owner queue
  s5 --> s6: Owner starts the seed: install Pending
  s5 --> s7: Clear discards the queue with receipts
  s4 --> s8: Queue the seed again after the clear
  s6 --> s9: Clear discards the queue with receipts
  s6 --> s11: Submit the first input and bind the source
  s8 --> s10: Owner starts the seed: install Pending
  s7 --> s6: Owner starts an input: install Pending
  s11 --> s12: Submit an input to the successor once or Clear discards the queue with receipts or Submit the first input and bind the source
  s12 --> s11: Accept an input into the owner queue
  s6 --> s7: Submit the first input and bind the source
  s10 --> s10: Create the pane once or Submit the first input and bind the source or Submit an input to the successor once
